<title>JORDAN: Jordan average dinar o/nite rates drop to 4.29 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan average dinar o/nite rates drop to 4.29 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 4.39 percent on Tuesday from 5.34 percent on Monday, the central bank said</p>
<p>It said five banks traded in nine reported transactions worth 10.8 million dinars ($15 million) in a trading range of between 4 to 5 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
